    followUp: "Review in 48-72 hours to assess treatment response. If improving, continue amoxicillin for full 5-7 day course and review at 1-2 weeks. If not improving, switch to amoxicillin-clavulanate and consider ENT referral. If recurrent AOM (3+ episodes in 6 months or 4+ in 12 months): refer to ENT for assessment and consider prophylactic antibiotics or myringotomy with ventilation tube insertion. Ensure pneumococcal and influenza vaccination status is up to date.",
